<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Sea Gloria - 150,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Kwangyang plus Pohang 5-20/11 $9.22 fio eight days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>Dubrovnik - 55,000 tonnes bauxite Kamsar/Aughinish 18-25/10 $4.75 fio 24,000/15,000 Klaveness.</p>
<p>Bunga Saga Satu - 50,000 tonnes ore Lulea/Ijmuiden spot $4.50 fio five days shinc Hoogovens.</p>
</text>
